Logical: SaveFormPageRequest
Id: saveformpage-request
Title: "SaveFormPage — Request"
Description: "Logisk modell för requestparametrar i SaveFormPage."
Characteristics: #can-be-target

* ^version = "2.1"
* formId 1..1 string "formId" "formId"
* pageAnswer 1..1 Base "PageAnswerType" "pageAnswer"
* pageAnswer.pageNumber 1..1 integer "pageNumber" "pageNumber"
* pageAnswer.questionAnswerBlocks 1..* Base "QuestionBlockAnswersType" "questionAnswerBlocks"
* pageAnswer.questionAnswerBlocks.blockNumber 1..1 integer "blockNumber" "blockNumber"
* pageAnswer.questionAnswerBlocks.questionAnswers 1..* Base "QuestionAnswerType" "questionAnswers"
* pageAnswer.questionAnswerBlocks.questionAnswers.answers 1..* Base "AnswerType" "answers"
* pageAnswer.questionAnswerBlocks.questionAnswers.answers.answerAlternativeNumber 0..1 integer "Svarsalternativets id/nummer." "Svarsalternativets id/nummer."
* pageAnswer.questionAnswerBlocks.questionAnswers.answers.answerStatus 0..1 Base "AnswerStatusType" "answerStatus"
* pageAnswer.questionAnswerBlocks.questionAnswers.answers.answerStatus.resultCode 1..1 code "resultCode" "Signalerar om frågan är ifylld på ett felaktigt sätt. Felkod. OK - Transaktion utförd INFO - Transaktion utförd med kommentar. ERROR - Transaktion ej genomförd Tillåtna värden: OK, ERROR, INFO."
* pageAnswer.questionAnswerBlocks.questionAnswers.answers.answerStatus.resultCodeText 1..1 string "Felmeddelande, förklarande text. Vid INFO eller ERROR. T.ex. INFO – Medtag legitimation." "Felmeddelande, förklarande text. Vid INFO eller ERROR. T.ex. INFO – Medtag legitimation."
* pageAnswer.questionAnswerBlocks.questionAnswers.answers.value 0..1 string "Patientens/användarens svar." "Patientens/användarens svar."
* pageAnswer.questionAnswerBlocks.questionAnswers.questionNumber 1..1 integer "questionNumber" "questionNumber"
* subjectOfCare 0..1 string "subjectOfCare" "Autentiserad invånare (personnummer). FormTemplate.anonymousForm styr huruvida formulärmotorn hanterar detta fält som obligatoriskt eller frivilligt."
* temporarySave 0..1 boolean "Formuläret skall sparas temporärt. - Indata skall ej valideras. - Samma CurrentPage returneras." "Formuläret skall sparas temporärt. - Indata skall ej valideras. - Samma CurrentPage returneras."
* actor 0..1 Base "ActorType" "actor"
* actor.actorId 1..1 IIType "actorId" "actorId"
* actor.actorType 1..1 code "actorType" "actorType Tillåtna värden: CITIZEN, GUARDIAN, CAREGIVER."
